roire ...\"","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:04.52] <00:04.52>I <00:04.81>mi <00:05.23>tant <00:05.37>Cour <00:05.56>te <00:05.75>line, <00:06.79>un <00:07.07>scep <00:07.49>ti <00:07.64>que <00:07.83>no <00:08.01>toire,\n[00:09.05] <00:09.05>Ma <00:09.33>ni <00:09.76>fes <00:09.90>tant <00:10.09>ain <00:10.28>si <00:11.32>que <00:11.60>l'on <00:12.02>me <00:12.16>dé <00:12.35>sa <00:12.54>buse,\n[00:13.58] <00:13.58>J'ai <00:13.86>des <00:14.29>vel <00:14.43>lé <00:14.62>i <00:14.81>tés <00:15.84>d'ar <00:16.13>pen <00:16.55>ter <00:16.69>les <00:16.88>trot <00:17.07>toirs\n[00:18.11] <00:18.11>A <00:18.39>vec <00:18.82>cet <00:18.96>te <00:19.15>de <00:19.33>vise <00:20.37>é <00:20.66>crite <00:21.08>à <00:21.22>mon <00:21.41>gi <00:21.60>bus :\n[00:22.64] <00:22.64>\"Je <00:22.92>ne <00:23.34>crois <00:23.49>pas <00:23.67>un <00:23.86>mot <00:24.90>de <00:25.18>tou <00:25.61>tes <00:25.75>ces <00:25.94>his <00:26.13>toires.\"\n[00:31.69] <00:31.69>Dieu, <00:31.98>dia <00:32.40>ble, <00:32.54>pa <00:32.73>ra <00:32.92>dis, <00:33.96>en <00:34.24>fer <00:34.66>et <00:34.81>pur <00:34.99>ga <00:35.18>toire,\n[00:36.22] <00:36.22>Les <00:36.50>bons <00:36.93>ré <00:37.07>com <00:37.26>pen <00:37.45>sés <00:38.49>et <00:38.77>les <00:39.19>mé <00:39.33>chants <00:39.52>pu <00:39.71>nis,\n[00:40.75] <00:40.75>Et <00:41.03>le <00:41.46>corps <00:41.60>du <00:41.79>Sei <00:41.98>gneur <00:43.01>dans <00:43.30>le <00:43.72>fond <00:43.86>du <00:44.05>ci <00:44.24>boire,\n[00:45.28] <00:45.28>Et <00:45.56>l'hui <00:45.99>le <00:46.13>con <00:46.32>sa <00:46.50>crée <00:47.54>com <00:47.83>me <00:48.25>le <00:48.39>pain <00:48.58>bé <00:48.77>nit,\n[00:49.81] <00:49.81>\"Je <00:50.09>ne <00:50.51>crois <00:50.66>pas <00:50.84>un <00:51.03>mot <00:52.07>de <00:52.35>tou <00:52.78>tes <00:52.92>ces <00:53.11>his <00:53.30>toires.\"\n[00:58.86] <00:58.86>Et <00:59.15>la <00:59.57>bonne <00:59.71>a <00:59.90>ven <01:00.09>ture <01:01.13>et <01:01.41>l'art <01:01.83>di <01:01.98>v